{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="self-drive">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>Self-Drive & 4x4 Hire</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Explore Zanzibar at your own pace with a rental car or 4x4 vehicle, with flexible pickup and drop-off options.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Why Self-Drive in Zanzibar</span>
        <h2>Freedom to Explore</h2>
        <p>Renting a car gives you the flexibility to discover Zanzibar's diverse attractions on your own schedule. From Stone Town's historic streets to remote beaches in the south, a self-drive trip puts you in control of your adventure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="highlights-grid">
        <div class="highlight-item reveal">
          <h3>Flexibility</h3>
          <p>Create your own itinerary, stop at viewpoints that catch your eye, and linger as long as you like at each location. No fixed tour schedules or group constraints.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item reveal delay-2">
          <h3>Access to Remote Areas</h3>
          <p>Reach secluded beaches, hidden coves, and villages that are difficult to access by public transport. The east and south coasts are particularly rewarding with a rental vehicle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="highlight-item reveal delay-3">
          <h3>Cost-Effective for Groups</h3>
          <p>For families or small groups, self-drive can be more economical than multiple tour bookings, especially for a 3-7 day stay.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Vehicle Options</span>
        <h2>Available Rental Categories</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="vehicle-grid">
        <div class="vehicle-item reveal">
          <h3>Compact Cars</h3>
          <p>Suitable for city driving and well-maintained roads around Stone Town and north coast. Good fuel economy and easy parking. Examples: Toyota Prius, Vios, or similar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vehicle-item reveal delay-2">
          <h3>SUVs & Crossovers</h3>
          <p>Higher ground clearance for varied road conditions. Comfortable for small groups with luggage space. Examples: Toyota RAV4, Honda CR-V, or similar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="vehicle-item reveal delay-3">
          <h3>4x4 Pickup & Expedition Vehicles</h3>
          <p>Essential for south and east coast exploration, especially during rainy season when some roads may be challenging. Includes roof rack for gear. Examples: Toyota Land Cruiser, Nissan Patrol, or similar.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">Important Information</span>
        <h2>Rental Guidelines</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="guidelines-grid">
        <div class="guideline-item reveal">
          <h3>Driving License</h3>
          <p>Valid international driving permit recommended. Must have license held for at least 1 year. Stone Town driving is on the left.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="guideline-item reveal delay-2">
          <h3>Insurance</h3>
          <p>Basic insurance included. Comprehensive coverage available at additional cost. Check what's covered regarding off-road driving and gravel roads.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="guideline-item reveal delay-3">
          <h3>Fuel Policy</h3>
          <p>Rentals provided with full tank, return with full tank. Fuel stations are available in Stone Town, but sparse on south and east coasts — plan accordingly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="guideline-item reveal delay-4">
          <h3>Age Requirements</h3>
          <p>Minimum age 23, maximum 70. Young driver surcharge may apply for drivers under 25. Some categories may have upper age limits.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="cta-content reveal">
      <h2>Reserve Your Vehicle Today</h2>
      <p>Message us on WhatsApp with your preferred vehicle type, pickup date, and duration, and we'll arrange competitive rates with trusted rental partners.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="https://wa.me/255672450934?text=I'm interested in self-drive car rental in Zanzibar" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Vehicle Inquiry</a>
        <a href="/transfers/" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg">Airport Transfers</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="supplementary-cta">
    {% if page.intent %}
      <p>Still have questions about self-drive in Zanzibar? <span class="whatsapp-cta">{{ page.intent.cta_text }}</span></p>
    {% else %}
      <p>Still have questions? <span class="whatsapp-cta">{{ default.intent.cta_text }}</span></p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

  {% include "footer.njk" %}
</main>